Message-ID: <BE129D1A0A253A4BA526C4500064850AFCE5F9@sew01065.maple.fg.rbc.com>

Pat,

 

The 
problem is that the number of observation times ('obs.times') must have the same 
length as your data values for the series ('white.noise'). If you wanted 60 
observations each at 4 observation times, set ncol=60 when you 
initialize 'whitenoise'. If you wanted 4 observations each at 60 
observation times, you need 60 dates in your 'obs.times' 
variable. 

 

Hope 
this helps.

 

W.

 

