At 01:09 PM 8/18/2005 +0000, Jose Bartolomei wrote:

> Dear S-Plus users,

>

> I have a character column within a data set that has values with 7
and 8 characters of length.

>

> Which is your recommended way to add a 0at the left of those values
with 7 characters only?

>

>

