See my comment about it not working on 2.6.x kernels.  You do not want a 
non-functional basic option.  Also, you do not want it in non-interactive 
use.  (R has been taught to distinguish such uses, but does have a 
command-line flag to turn the command-line editing off in case it gets 
it wrong.)

